\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 # Coco V\'e0 B\'ed \uc0\u7848 n Chi\u7871 c L\'f4ng C\u7847 u V\u7891 ng\
\
Trong khu r\uc0\u7915 ng nhi\u7879 t \u273 \u7899 i \u273 \u7847 y m\'e0u s\u7855 c, c\'f3 m\u7897 t ch\'fa v\u7865 t nh\u7887  t\'ean l\'e0 **Coco**.\
\
Coco r\uc0\u7845 t y\'eau b\u7897  l\'f4ng s\u7863 c s\u7905  c\u7911 a m\'ecnh, \u273 \u7863 c bi\u7879 t l\'e0 chi\u7871 c l\'f4ng \u273 u\'f4i d\'e0i c\'f3 \u273 \u7911  m\'e0u \u273 \u7887 , xanh v\'e0 v\'e0ng.\
\
M\uc0\u7897 t bu\u7893 i s\'e1ng, khi th\u7913 c d\u7853 y, Coco gi\u7853 t m\'ecnh k\'eau l\'ean:\
\
\'97 \'d4i kh\'f4ng! Chi\uc0\u7871 c l\'f4ng c\u7847 u v\u7891 ng c\u7911 a m\'ecnh \u273 \'e2u r\u7891 i?\
\
Coco t\'ecm kh\uc0\u7855 p t\u7893 .\
\
T\'ecm tr\'ean c\'e0nh c\'e2y.\
\
T\'ecm d\uc0\u432 \u7899 i b\u7909 i hoa.\
\
Nh\uc0\u432 ng chi\u7871 c l\'f4ng qu\'fd gi\'e1 v\u7851 n bi\u7871 n m\u7845 t.\
\
\'97 M\'ecnh ph\uc0\u7843 i t\'ecm ra ai \u273 \'e3 l\u7845 y n\'f3! \'97 Coco quy\u7871 t t\'e2m.\
\
Th\uc0\u7871  l\'e0 cu\u7897 c \u273 i\u7873 u tra b\u7855 t \u273 \u7847 u.\
\
Manh m\uc0\u7889 i \u273 \u7847 u ti\'ean l\'e0 v\'e0i chi\u7871 c l\'f4ng m\'e0u xanh n\u7857 m g\u7847 n t\u7893 .\
\
\'97 Ch\uc0\u7855 c l\'e0 ch\'fa c\'f4ng xanh r\u7891 i! \'97 Coco \u273 o\'e1n.\
\
Nh\uc0\u432 ng c\'f4ng xanh l\u7855 c \u273 \u7847 u:\
\
\'97 B\uc0\u7897  l\'f4ng c\u7911 a m\'ecnh \u273 \'e3 \u273 \u7911  \u273 \u7865 p r\u7891 i. M\'ecnh \u273 \'e2u c\u7847 n l\'f4ng c\u7911 a c\u7853 u.\
\
Coco ti\uc0\u7871 p t\u7909 c t\'ecm ki\u7871 m.\
\
B\uc0\u7895 ng c\u7853 u nghe th\u7845 y ti\u7871 ng c\u432 \u7901 i kh\'fac kh\'edch t\u7915  ph\'eda h\u7891  n\u432 \u7899 c.\
\
M\uc0\u7897 t \u273 \'e0n kh\u7881  \u273 ang ch\u417 i \u273 \'f9a.\
\
\'97 C\'f3 ph\uc0\u7843 i c\'e1c c\u7853 u l\u7845 y chi\u7871 c l\'f4ng c\u7911 a m\'ecnh kh\'f4ng?\
\
\'97 Kh\'f4ng \uc0\u273 \'e2u! \'97 c\u7843  \u273 \'e0n \u273 \u7891 ng thanh tr\u7843  l\u7901 i.\
\
Cu\uc0\u7897 c \u273 i\u7873 u tra l\u7841 i r\u417 i v\'e0o b\u7871  t\u7855 c.\
\
\uc0\u272 \'fang l\'fac \u7845 y, Coco nh\'ecn th\u7845 y m\u7897 t th\u7913  g\'ec \u273 \'f3 l\u7845 p l\'e1nh tr\'ean c\'e0nh c\'e2y cao.\
\
C\uc0\u7853 u v\u7895  \u273 \'f4i c\'e1nh bay l\'ean.\
\
V\'e0 r\uc0\u7891 i...\
\
\'97 A! T\'ecm th\uc0\u7845 y r\u7891 i!\
\
Chi\uc0\u7871 c l\'f4ng c\u7847 u v\u7891 ng \u273 ang m\u7855 c tr\'ean m\u7897 t c\'e0nh c\'e2y.\
\
H\'f3a ra h\'f4m qua, khi Coco bay th\uc0\u7853 t nhanh \u273 \u7875  \u273 u\u7893 i theo m\u7897 t c\u417 n gi\'f3, chi\u7871 c l\'f4ng \u273 \'e3 v\'f4 t\'ecnh r\u417 i ra v\'e0 m\u7855 c l\u7841 i \u7903  \u273 \'f3.\
\
Coco b\uc0\u7853 t c\u432 \u7901 i:\
\
\'97 Th\'ec ra ch\uc0\u7859 ng ai l\u7845 y c\u7843 !\
\
B\'e1c c\'fa gi\'e0 \uc0\u273 ang \u273 \u7853 u g\u7847 n \u273 \'f3 m\u7881 m c\u432 \u7901 i:\
\
\'97 \uc0\u272 \'f4i khi, tr\u432 \u7899 c khi v\u7897 i k\u7871 t lu\u7853 n, ch\'fang ta n\'ean t\'ecm hi\u7875 u th\u7853 t k\u7929  c\'e1c manh m\u7889 i.\
\
Coco g\uc0\u7853 t \u273 \u7847 u.\
\
C\uc0\u7853 u c\u7849 n th\u7853 n c\u7845 t chi\u7871 c l\'f4ng l\u7841 i r\u7891 i bay m\u7897 t v\'f2ng tr\'ean b\u7847 u tr\u7901 i xanh.\
\
T\uc0\u7915  tr\'ean cao, b\u7897  l\'f4ng r\u7921 c r\u7905  c\u7911 a c\u7853 u l\u7845 p l\'e1nh d\u432 \u7899 i \'e1nh n\u7855 ng.\
\
V\'e0 Coco ch\uc0\u7907 t nh\u7899  ra m\u7897 t \u273 i\u7873 u:\
\
\uc0\u272 i\u7873 u \u273 \u7863 c bi\u7879 t nh\u7845 t kh\'f4ng ph\u7843 i l\'e0 m\u7897 t chi\u7871 c l\'f4ng duy nh\u7845 t.\
\
M\'e0 l\'e0 c\uc0\u7843  b\u7897  l\'f4ng \u273 \u7847 y m\'e0u s\u7855 c m\'e0 thi\'ean nhi\'ean \u273 \'e3 ban t\u7863 ng cho lo\'e0i v\u7865 t.
